  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p data-end=\"536\" data-start=\"103\"><strong data-end=\"126\" data-start=\"103\">Brand Introduction:</strong><br data-end=\"129\" data-start=\"126\">Crossbank Clothing is a USA-based apparel brand dedicated to celebrating billiards culture through bold, stylish fashion. Founded in 2024 by Cobey Cross, the brand was born from a deep love of the game and a desire to help players “<em>Show the World You're a Pool Player.</em>” We design every piece with authenticity and comfort in mind, creating a lifestyle brand for those who live and breathe billiards.</p><p data-end=\"890\" data-start=\"538\"><strong data-end=\"562\" data-start=\"538\">Product Description:</strong><br data-end=\"565\" data-start=\"562\">We offer high-quality, ultra-soft t-shirts and hoodies that feature original, billiards-themed graphics — from clever sayings to cultural nods and creative designs that resonate with real pool players. All products are printed, packaged, and shipped in the USA, with a 30-day return policy that ensures customer satisfaction.</p><p data-end=\"1314\" data-start=\"892\"><strong data-end=\"923\" data-start=\"892\">Unique Selling Point (USP):</strong><br data-end=\"926\" data-start=\"923\">Crossbank Clothing is 100% focused on the identity and lifestyle of billiards players. Our designs go beyond generic cues — they tap into the real spirit, language, and pride of pool culture. With a fast-growing community and a distinctive, underserved niche, affiliates have the chance to promote a brand with strong customer loyalty and repeat purchase potential.</p><p data-end=\"1526\" data-start=\"1316\"><strong data-end=\"1334\" data-start=\"1316\">Payment Terms:</strong><br data-end=\"1337\" data-start=\"1334\">Affiliates earn a generous <strong data-end=\"1396\" data-start=\"1364\">10% commission on every sale</strong>, with <strong data-end=\"1429\" data-start=\"1403\">30-day cookie tracking</strong> and payouts via PayPal or Bank transfer. No cap, no limits — just solid earning potential in a unique niche.</p><p data-end=\"1841\" data-start=\"1528\"><strong data-end=\"1550\" data-start=\"1528\">Other Information:</strong><br data-end=\"1553\" data-start=\"1550\">• Dedicated affiliate dashboard for real-time tracking<br data-end=\"1610\" data-start=\"1607\">• Custom coupon codes available upon request<br data-end=\"1657\" data-start=\"1654\">• High-converting website optimized for mobile and desktop<br data-end=\"1718\" data-start=\"1715\">• Frequent product drops and seasonal promotions to boost sales<br data-end=\"1784\" data-start=\"1781\">• Responsive affiliate support to help you succeed</p><p data-end=\"1966\" data-start=\"1843\">Join the Crossbank Clothing affiliate program today and start earning by promoting the game you love — one shirt at a time.</p></div>",
